                                                                            \\n   1                                       Phone Number              (555) 123-4567                                                                                                                      \\n   2                                    **Payment Amount Due** $      3,739.73                                                                                                                             \\n   4 MINNIE MOUSE                                                                                                                                                                               \\n   1 1375 MOUSE RD                                                                                                                                                                                        \\n   1 ANYTOWN PA 12345                                                                                                                                                               \\n017  Account Activity Summary               Explanation of Amount Due                                                                                                                                     \\n   1 Outstanding Balance  $    650,000.00   Monthly Payment        $      3,739.73                                                                                                                        \\n   1 Payments and Credits $      4,140.41       Principal          $          0.00                                                                                                                        \\n   1 Advances and Debits  $          0.00       Interest        $         3,739.73                                                                                                                        \\n   1 Interest Paid this Year $             8,182.87                                                         